# Build contexts are the repository root; keep host-only state out of them so an
# image never inherits a local virtualenv, node_modules or database.
**/.venv
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[oc]
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/dist
# Never bake a host secrets file into an image; the services read the key from
# the environment instead (see compose.yaml).
**/.env
**/staticfiles
**/db.sqlite3
**/db.sqlite3-wal
**/db.sqlite3-shm
.git
.github
docs
e2e
**/*.pdf
